4,1,,status,George,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,Hello everyone. I hope we can find a plan that is realistic. I am a bit worried about how our schedules often slip.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,Hi! I'm so excited to help! I think we should really look at how the rooms are actually being used by students and staff.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,It is important to consider the people who keep these facilities running. We cannot ignore the operational burden on our staff.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree with Yumi. However, we should also look at the outcomes of previous projects to avoid repeating the same mistakes.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A pleasure to be here. While user satisfaction is charming, I suspect our budget projections are perhaps more optimistic than the market is kind.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Benjamin, that is a very good point. If the budget is wrong, the timeline usually suffers too.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,I wonder if we can see how many rooms are actually out of service during these projects? It would be sad if students had nowhere to go!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,"I am more concerned with the daily routines. If a new facility adds more manual work for the technicians, it is a poor choice.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Exactly. We need to know if the ""improvements"" we've made in the past actually served their purpose or just looked good on paper.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Precisely, Mizuki. I am quite interested in whether the figures approved in our meetings actually survive contact with the real world.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"I think looking at the site diaries might tell us why things get delayed. Weather is one thing, but there is often more.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I'll definitely look into the booking data! I want to make sure we are building things that people actually need and use.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,I will examine the staffing posts and the technicians' routines. We must know who is actually doing the work.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I will focus on the post-occupancy reviews and the survey findings from the older blocks. We need the users' honest voices.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I shall investigate the tender records and the renewal reserves. I want to see the gap between our estimates and the actual costs.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I will also look at the delivery schedules. It would be lovely to see if there is a pattern to these delays.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I'll also check the timetable records for rooms out of service. Let's make sure we don't disrupt the classes too much!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
